# bath_core — a compact 3-piece bathroom that never trips the fixture-clearance
# checks. Author it in its own local feet (SW corner at 0,0); the `use ... at`
# on the host places it. A bathroom auto-seeds its toilet, lavatory and tub, so
# no `fixture` lines are needed here — the seed layout clears IRC R307.1.
room bath: bathroom at 0,0 size 8 x 6
# A window daylights + ventilates the bath (place the part so this wall is
# exterior, or accept BATH_VENT on the host `use` line for an interior core).
window bath south casement width 2.5 offset 2.75 sill 4 tempered
